# Ignore local noise
*.log
audit-output/

# Machine-local lab notes (copy from lab-host.example.md)
docs/lab-host.md

# Ad-hoc lab drafts (may contain host paths)
scripts/_drafts/

# Cursor agent / VM workspace state (not part of the product)
.cursor/

# Proton Drive conflict copies. Example:
#   BACKLOG (# Edit conflict 2026-08-19 eqih1yC #).md
# Matcher is the distinctive "Edit conflict" token so gitignore `#`
# comments cannot truncate the pattern. Canonical file wins after a human check.
**/*Edit conflict*
